      "id": "ukteah3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Nature of Light"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Light behaves as an electromagnetic wave and exhibits dual nature under different conditions.",
        "Reflection of light occurs on smooth and rough surfaces, classified into regular and diffused reflection.",
        "Refraction involves the bending of light waves when passing from one medium to another due to speed change.",
        "Optical instruments and lenses manipulate light rays to form magnified, inverted, or virtual images.",
        "Dispersion splits white light into its constituent colors when passing through a prism."
      ],
      "id": "m9xah9t"
    },
